sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be released on bail in respect of Crime No.62/2023 registered by Arehalli Police Station, Hassan pending on the file of Principal Civil Judge (Jr.Dn.) and JMFC, Belur, Hassan District for the offences punishable under Section 376(N), 504, 506 of IPC, subject to the following conditions:-
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees One lakh only) with one surety for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
NC: 2023:KHC:40406 b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
SD/-
